-   "role_en": "Wall breaker, opens the way",
+   "role_en": "Breaks walls open",
    "story_zh": "一頭火紅刺蝟頭、披著毛茸茸的獸皮，左右手各一把大斧。它不在乎自己砍了多少，只要把對面的大盾劈出裂縫，後面的弓箭手和劍士就能一擁而上。被小馬撞到也紋風不動。",
    "story_en": "A fiery spiky head, a fluffy pelt and a big axe in each hand. It doesn't care how much damage it does — it just splits the enemy's shields so the archers and swords behind can pour in. Even a charging pony can't budge it.",
    "tagline_zh": "盾牌？借我看一下。",
@@ -320,7 +320,7 @@
   {
    "id": 10,
    "role_zh": "不會動的毒圈封路",
-   "role_en": "Stationary poison roadblock",
+   "role_en": "Poison roadblock",
    "story_zh": "住在森林裡的蘑菇，被傭兵公會的傳單騙來當兵。它不會走路，也懶得走路，只要有人踩進它的地盤，就噗地噴一口孢子。隊友都說它是全軍最穩的同事，因為它真的不會動。",
    "story_en": "A forest mushroom lured in by a guild flyer. It can't walk and wouldn't want to. Step on its turf and it puffs out spores. Teammates call it the steadiest soldier around, because it truly never moves.",
    "tagline_zh": "別踩我的草皮",
@@ -410,7 +410,7 @@
   {
    "id": 13,
    "role_zh": "打不完的前排",
-   "role_en": "The front line that keeps coming",
+   "role_en": "Endless front line",
    "story_zh": "一團黏黏的東西，對任何事都很樂觀。被砍成兩半時它會說「太好了，多一個朋友」。小史萊姆長大後會忘記對方，然後在下一場互相打招呼。",
    "story_en": "A cheerful blob, optimistic about everything. Cut in half, it says, \"Great, one more friend.\" The slimelets forget each other and say hello again next battle.",
    "tagline_zh": "我們是一夥的，也是兩夥的",
@@ -440,7 +440,7 @@
   {
    "id": 14,
    "role_zh": "穿牆獵殺後排",
-   "role_en": "Back-line hunter through walls",
+   "role_en": "Hunts the back line",
    "story_zh": "它不記得自己怎麼死的，只記得還有東西沒吃完。穿過前排時它會小聲說「借過」，然後直直飄到弓箭手面前，弓箭手通常會射它，箭會穿過去，弓箭手通常會哭。",
    "story_en": "It can't recall how it died, only that it left a snack unfinished. Slipping through the front line, it whispers \"excuse me,\" drifts up to the archer, gets shot, the arrow passes through, and the archer usually cries.",
    "tagline_zh": "借過，我趕時間",
@@ -500,7 +500,7 @@
   {
    "id": 16,
    "role_zh": "關鍵時刻的時停",
-   "role_en": "Time stop at the clutch moment",
+   "role_en": "Clutch time stop",
    "story_zh": "一隻從時鐘店逃出來的小精靈，沙子流完就會打瞌睡。隊友快撐不住的時候，它會用力敲一下自己的玻璃，全場安靜兩秒半。它覺得兩秒半夠長了，反正大家都很急。",
    "story_en": "A little sprite that fled a clock shop and nods off when the sand runs out. When allies are failing, it knocks on its own glass and everything goes quiet for two and a half seconds. It thinks two and a half seconds is plenty, since everyone's always in a hurry.",
    "tagline_zh": "再等兩秒",
